ain-text product names in AJAX search responses. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/68191\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#68191</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add a &#8220;Send test email&#8221; action to the emails listing page (block email editor). <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/66405\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#66405</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add a feature-gated public order withdrawal endpoint. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/66538\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#66538</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add a filter for product attribute taxonomy row actions in the Attributes admin table. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/66633\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#66633</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add Airwallex to payment providers recommendations in Japan. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/67359\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#67359</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add an opt-in compute_totals mode to POST /wc/v3/orders/{id}/refunds that computes per-line refund amounts server-side from quantities, validated against the order&#8217;s refund history. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/67613\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#67613</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add an order withdrawal inbox notification for EU-selling live stores. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/67295\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#67295</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add a refund preview endpoint (POST /wc/v3/orders/{id}/refunds/preview) that returns server-computed refund totals and per-line breakdowns without creating a refund. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/67613\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#67613</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add beta support for videos in product galleries. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/65396\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#65396</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add CatalogSortOrder enum class for woocommerce_default_catalog_orderby option values and adopt it in the Product Collection block query builder. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/66877\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#66877</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add click tracking for the Things to do next task list. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/66125\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#66125</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add contextual image metadata to onboarding tasks via Task::get_image_url() and Task::get_image_alt(), so third-party tasks can supply their own illustration for My Home and the legacy dashboard setup widget. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/66500\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#66500</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add coupon validation filters for product_ids, product_categories, sale_items, excluded_items, excluded_product_ids, and excluded_product_categories in WC_Discounts. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/64363\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#64363</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add GoCardless as a recommended payment partner extension for GB (UK) merchants. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/67336\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#67336</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add Helcim to payment method recommendations in the United States and Canada. <a href=\"https://github.com/woocommerce/woocommerce/pull/66960\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">#66960</a></li>\n<li>Add &#8211; Add KOMOJU  &hellip;</li>\n</ul>\n\";s:11:\"screenshots\";s:1035:\"<ol><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3234504\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3234504\" alt=\"\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3234504\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3234504\" alt=\"\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=3641137\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=3641137\" alt=\"\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=3641137\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=3641137\" alt=\"\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-5.png?rev=3234504\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-5.png?rev=3234504\" alt=\"\"></a></li><li><a href=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-6.png?rev=3234504\"><img src=\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-6.png?rev=3234504\" alt=\"\"></a></li></ol>\";s:7:\"reviews\";s:17623:\"<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Everything is hard</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"1 من 5 نجوم\" data-title-template=\"%s من 5 نجوم\" data-rating=\"1\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				بواسطة <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/das2019/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45e32a199577635a48a036a6e5f066310f81fdffb46db08a7fda1ee349688238?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/45e32a199577635a48a036a6e5f066310f81fdffb46db08a7fda1ee349688238?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/das2019/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">das2019</a> في <span class=\"review-date\">سبتمبر 9, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It works... But I dread having to add or change anything. Simple bulk editing like changing tags of more than 5 products leads to gateway timeout, with some being changed and some not. Editing them one-by-one takes about as much time as waiting for the timeout. Setting up shipping categories-zones-costs is a confusing and convoluted nightmare of multiple screens, tabs, and settings. Misleading warning popups like \"all of these items will be deleted\" instead of \"clicking OK will delete this category name\". And too much of what seems like basic functionality requires paid third-party plugins. It\'s always like that, these examples are just from the last two hours of struggle.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">It&#039;s good</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 من 5 نجوم\" data-title-template=\"%s من 5 نجوم\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				بواسطة <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/almahmudbd/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/079a5e72d2d54c7590ddb0047a7ac2b43ae59bc08a6104fcf3fdc697bdec1cc3?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/079a5e72d2d54c7590ddb0047a7ac2b43ae59bc08a6104fcf3fdc697bdec1cc3?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/almahmudbd/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">almahmud <small>(almahmudbd)</small></a> في <span class=\"review-date\">سبتمبر 9, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s good and so much flexible...</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>thanks</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Every release is a new surprise on how it breaks my website.</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"2 من 5 نجوم\" data-title-template=\"%s من 5 نجوم\" data-rating=\"2\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				بواسطة <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sybydesign/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/307766eb54bca9c928d5a7514b55c3316a6128618c0fc07943ed3ebfa1972a50?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/307766eb54bca9c928d5a7514b55c3316a6128618c0fc07943ed3ebfa1972a50?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/sybydesign/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">sybydesign</a> في <span class=\"review-date\">سبتمبر 3, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>WooCommerce update 11.1.0 – Endless scroll of fixes – because of the endless bugs.<br />They have NO concept of Quality!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Woo was once pretty good. Now, it is endless bugs and abysmal quality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>4 Stars for function (when it is working).<br />1 Star for quality releases.<br />1 Star for Support.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The worst experience I have ever had with any WordPress related support. 5 weeks of misdirection! So bad, they even sent me an apology.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>It\'s bad that they rely so heavily on AI for support - worse that humans don\'t even look to oversee it - and disastrous that they don\'t give the AI current version information. That is totally bone-headed!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I should not be surprised because the software too is released without thinking. Just look at the endless scroll of fixes with release 11.1.0   What will break on my site this time?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great support</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 من 5 نجوم\" data-title-template=\"%s من 5 نجوم\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				بواسطة <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/simonelongato/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/11266e931b9a30aaeeae780c7f75caee6982c8044fcffc63cbdaf196a251234a?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/11266e931b9a30aaeeae780c7f75caee6982c8044fcffc63cbdaf196a251234a?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/simonelongato/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">Simone Longato <small>(simonelongato)</small></a> في <span class=\"review-date\">أغسطس 26, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I needed support for some errors in the e-commerce site I manage for our clients. They helped us understand the problem so we could fix it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great Plugin</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 من 5 نجوم\" data-title-template=\"%s من 5 نجوم\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				بواسطة <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/abh123/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b03ff597cf83827ff95f87a0c31f5bbeee934df6b84fb00e827dda4ec7be0172?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b03ff597cf83827ff95f87a0c31f5bbeee934df6b84fb00e827dda4ec7be0172?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/abh123/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">abh123</a> في <span class=\"review-date\">أغسطس 23, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is very <strong><em>Great</em></strong> plugin for <strong><em>ecommerce</em></strong> store.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Great plugin, great support</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 من 5 نجوم\" data-title-template=\"%s من 5 نجوم\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				بواسطة <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wonderland32/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/16f9ca6da8b059829ceab9fb4e0937f4289aea3d1ffb317c1bb91b3cf73febef?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/16f9ca6da8b059829ceab9fb4e0937f4289aea3d1ffb317c1bb91b3cf73febef?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/wonderland32/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">wonderland32</a> في <span class=\"review-date\">أغسطس 17, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Glad I chose WooCommerce for my first webshop ever.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Defunct MCP shipped with latest WooCommerce (11.0.1) autoloads and breaks site</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"3 من 5 نجوم\" data-title-template=\"%s من 5 نجوم\" data-rating=\"3\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				بواسطة <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/egsteam/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e0557e1b762c8c1a3b7699cf2b5e6fcb5766b6c2a9135ea3a150017f8f635f0a?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e0557e1b762c8c1a3b7699cf2b5e6fcb5766b6c2a9135ea3a150017f8f635f0a?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/egsteam/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">egsteam</a> في <span class=\"review-date\">أغسطس 15, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I don\'t have any idea why you\'d ship a defunct MCP adapter (0.1) and have it autoload, even if someone has the feature turned off in settings.<br /><br />However, you\'ve broken one of my client\'s sites\' ability to utilize Zapier with their Formidable Forms because Formidable ships its own MCP that is REQUIRED for their Formidable API use (they are currently requiring 5.0&lt;=6.0).<br /><br />Who knows what other API needs other sites have that your darned autoloading is breaking.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Thanks!</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 من 5 نجوم\" data-title-template=\"%s من 5 نجوم\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				بواسطة <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/stratocaster/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1f72a61bdbccc42c0c39b2433d043adeeb8bba52539ef9938a478932d8153aee?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/1f72a61bdbccc42c0c39b2433d043adeeb8bba52539ef9938a478932d8153aee?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/stratocaster/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">stratocaster</a> في <span class=\"review-date\">أغسطس 14, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thanks for helping me out!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Billing Region Not Found Woo Commerce - Issue Resolved</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"4 من 5 نجوم\" data-title-template=\"%s من 5 نجوم\" data-rating=\"4\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-empty\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				بواسطة <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/jfaulkner78/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/302408bcbfeb405a1ac9aecd40ce1ddf026169bcb335829e624d57fbec0fb3c9?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/302408bcbfeb405a1ac9aecd40ce1ddf026169bcb335829e624d57fbec0fb3c9?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/jfaulkner78/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">jfaulkner78</a> في <span class=\"review-date\">أغسطس 13, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Representative was friendly and provided timely responses.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"review\">\n	<div class=\"review-head\">\n		<div class=\"reviewer-info\">\n			<div class=\"review-title-section\">\n				<h4 class=\"review-title\">Powerful, Flexible, and Easy to Customize</h4>\n				<div class=\"star-rating\">\n				<div class=\"wporg-ratings\" aria-label=\"5 من 5 نجوم\" data-title-template=\"%s من 5 نجوم\" data-rating=\"5\" style=\"color:#ffb900;\"><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span><span class=\"star dashicons dashicons-star-filled\"></span></div>				</div>\n			</div>\n			<p class=\"reviewer\">\n				بواسطة <a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/devgirl45/\"><img alt=\'\' src=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/dce00f99e4b11877ffe71fbfbd030fa74612a243bc76ba27b5fe87cab8273927?s=16&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g\' srcset=\'https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/dce00f99e4b11877ffe71fbfbd030fa74612a243bc76ba27b5fe87cab8273927?s=32&#038;d=monsterid&#038;r=g 2x\' class=\'avatar avatar-16 photo\' height=\'16\' width=\'16\' loading=\'lazy\' decoding=\'async\'/></a><a href=\"https://profiles.wordpress.org/devgirl45/\" class=\"reviewer-name\">devgirl45</a> في <span class=\"review-date\">أغسطس 13, 2026</span>			</p>\n		</div>\n	</div>\n	<div class=\"review-body\"><!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>I have been using WooCommerce for around 1.5 years for my business, and overall, it has been a very positive experience. The platform gives me a good level of flexibility and control over my online store. Managing products, orders, customers, payments, and store updates has become quite convenient. I also appreciate the wide range of plugins and integrations available, which makes it easier to add new features as the business grows. The customization options are another major advantage, allowing me to create a store that fits my business requirements. Overall, WooCommerce has been a reliable and practical e-commerce solution for my business.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Thanks to WordPress Team :-)</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n</div>\n\";}s:17:\"short_description\";s:275:\"كل ما تحتاج إليه لبدء متجر على الإنترنت في غضون أيام واستمرار تطويره لأعوام.  بدءًا من أول عملية بيع لك وصولاً إلى الملايين في الإيرادات، يكون Woo بجوارك.\";s:13:\"download_link\";s:61:\"https://downloads.wordpress.org/plugin/woocommerce.11.1.0.zip\";s:14:\"upgrade_notice\";a:0:{}s:11:\"screenshots\";a:6:{i:1;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-1.png?rev=3234504\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-2.png?rev=3234504\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";}i:3;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-3.png?rev=3641137\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";}i:4;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-4.png?rev=3641137\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-5.png?rev=3234504\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";}i:6;a:2:{s:3:\"src\";s:64:\"https://ps.w.org/woocommerce/assets/screenshot-6.png?rev=3234504\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"tags\";a:5:{s:9:\"ecommerce\";s:9:\"ecommerce\";s:12:\"online-store\";s:12:\"online store\";s:11:\"sell-online\";s:11:\"sell online\";s:4:\"shop\";s:4:\"shop\";s:13:\"shopping-cart\";s:13:\"shopping cart\";}s:8:\"versions\";a:648:{s